{
  "$origin": "FROZEN. The 121 cases the CLI's own normaliser (src/lib/source-key.ts before L3, byte-equivalent to connector-core at c44d1d4) was held to when schema v7 keyed existing rows. Never re-copy this file from the SDK: it exists so that an SDK patch which changes a key fails CI HERE, before it splits one stored item into two rows. If the change is deliberate, it needs a schema migration (re-key) and a new frozen file named for the new version.",
  "$comment": "Shared fixture table for normaliseSourceKey(platform, url). Published in @aligndottech/connector-core so every reader (CLI, gateway) checks one table. same: whether normaliseSourceKey(platform, a) === normaliseSourceKey(platform, b). key: the expected normaliseSourceKey(platform, a); null means undefined (no key). no_key cases have no b.",
  "rules": {
    "host_case": "Lowercase the scheme and the host. The path keeps its case.",
    "trailing_slash": "Drop trailing slashes from the path.",
    "fragment": "Drop the fragment.",
    "query": "Drop the query, except the parameters on the platform allowlist (confluence: pageId; slack: thread_ts), kept in name order.",
    "slug": "Drop a title-derived path segment that changes when the item is renamed (linear, confluence, notion).",
    "page_id": "Confluence: key by host, path prefix and page id only, so space and slug never split a page.",
    "workspace_host": "Slack: the host of an /archives/ path is slack.com, whichever workspace host the permalink used.",
    "github_owner_case": "github.com: owner and repo path segments are lowercased (GitHub treats them case-insensitively); the rest of the path keeps its case.",
    "percent_case": "Percent-escape hex digits are uppercased (%2f -> %2F).",
    "notion_peek": "Notion: a ?p=<pageid> peek URL is keyed by that page id.",
    "comment_anchor": "A URL pointing at a comment (GitHub #issuecomment-N, Jira focusedCommentId, Linear #comment-x) maps to its item: comments belong to their item, by design.",
    "no_key": "A synthetic identity (align://claimed/, align://unsourced/), a bare host (with or without a query), an Atlassian OAuth fallback URL (api.atlassian.com/ex/...), or an unparseable input gets no key: normaliseSourceKey returns undefined."
  },
